{"steam_appid":4625810,"steam_name":"Internet Survivor Survivors","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4625810/1997944346/97ab8af9f9d1cb9aeee60e983d38b85aa31b869b/1786514034/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786515136","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257397022/fee4a85354913e2ec6e4bdfd20063b410dc238c6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786515136","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/e6db578d925171b06532a8f8424d16f2fbb4b9f6/ss_e6db578d925171b06532a8f8424d16f2fbb4b9f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786954817","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/d1d741fd4af1edcee1002a301b2b09fb18746b39/ss_d1d741fd4af1edcee1002a301b2b09fb18746b39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786954817","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/dd7eeeedca4af7bef4270cfe023775d45334e079/ss_dd7eeeedca4af7bef4270cfe023775d45334e079.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786954817","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/f4dd88744f3c46be939ffdb67ff17a10e2004d2d/ss_f4dd88744f3c46be939ffdb67ff17a10e2004d2d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786954817","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/f050db850d82a407079f82008baa9941251a1a93/ss_f050db850d82a407079f82008baa9941251a1a93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786954817"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Annihilate the constant hordes of enemies, go viral, and survive, survive, SURVIVE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet Survivor Survivors is a top-down action roguelite Touhou fangame,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in which you play as Flan, who's... started streaming and has taken the internet by storm!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/23557df0f000d1846782b46ed6c941f2.gif?t=1786954817\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/23557df0f000d1846782b46ed6c941f2.poster.avif?t=1786954817\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/b6abb0f23aec845d56fe6b56206e8f0e.gif?t=1786954817\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/b6abb0f23aec845d56fe6b56206e8f0e.poster.avif?t=1786954817\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/53a4f1c15065b7c7dad7c3c2aaf43690.gif?t=1786954817\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/53a4f1c15065b7c7dad7c3c2aaf43690.poster.avif?t=1786954817\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of other familiar Touhou characters make appearances too, of course!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Just keep on beating enemies and never stop! ...Hey, haven't I seen these things online before!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/db2904e9cc4bf1af0e94b85f3fbd1a03.poster.avif?t=1786954817\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/db2904e9cc4bf1af0e94b85f3fbd1a03.webm?t=1786954817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/db2904e9cc4bf1af0e94b85f3fbd1a03.mp4?t=1786954817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect likes and coins to power up your weapons and stats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/595c2f404d66a65b42c4f45de7264e1e.avif?t=1786954817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras_big/595c2f404d66a65b42c4f45de7264e1e.avif?t=1786954817 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-For a streamer, their very viewer count is their life! Beat enemies to gain viewers, but get hit and you'll lose some!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/401b597999d803abd0a43dcb77fae1d5.poster.avif?t=1786954817\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/401b597999d803abd0a43dcb77fae1d5.webm?t=1786954817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/401b597999d803abd0a43dcb77fae1d5.mp4?t=1786954817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-If you lose all your viewers, Flan's phone will break and it'll be game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/90844784e033f2fb92f677d0cc3cea88.avif?t=1786954817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras_big/90844784e033f2fb92f677d0cc3cea88.avif?t=1786954817 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Keep streaming until time runs out and you'll clear the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/73000d55c2a95f1bde5635b4fa77f74a.poster.avif?t=1786954817\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/73000d55c2a95f1bde5635b4fa77f74a.webm?t=1786954817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/73000d55c2a95f1bde5635b4fa77f74a.mp4?t=1786954817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple controls let you have stress-free fun! C'mon, just give it a try and you'll see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/7229df5cbc9db82425cd1d193425cb70.avif?t=1786954817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras_big/7229df5cbc9db82425cd1d193425cb70.avif?t=1786954817 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name's Flandre Scarlet! I'm a newbie streamer, but I've got a LOT of eyes on me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird content, fun stuff, freaky memes, whatever... I'll play with all of you, no exceptions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm gonna destroy things, grow my numbers, and go viral! My goal is 1 million subs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you wait, big sis Remilia! I'll catch up to you in no time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras/1f29dff8d4c1a5e9aa50fe48d163aeb3.avif?t=1786954817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625810/extras_big/1f29dff8d4c1a5e9aa50fe48d163aeb3.webp?t=1786954817 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fangame based on the Touhou Project series,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and isn't an official work created by Team Shanghai Alice.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10 / 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8350U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["ビートまりお / COOL&CREATE"],"publishers":["ビートまりお / COOL&CREATE"],"release_date":"Aug 16, 2026"}